{{High Risk|Template:Featuring|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Adds a compact "featuring" badge to song list entries, marking who is featured on a track. Usually placed after {{T|Orikyoku}} in a song line. Repeat the template to credit more than one feature.
{{Shortcut|Template:feat}}

==Syntax==
{{T|Featuring|v1=name}} or {{T|Feat|V1=name}}

==Examples==
* {{T|Featuring|_Y_=1|p1=XYZ}}
* {{T|Featuring|_Y_=1|p1=[[USSS]]}}

Used in a full song list line:
<pre>* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Orikyoku|with={{VW|Kairiki Bear}}}} {{Featuring|XYZ}} {{Featuring|[[USSS]]}}</pre>
* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Orikyoku|with={{VW|Kairiki Bear}}}} {{Featuring|XYZ}} {{Featuring|[[USSS]]}}

